{"id": "34519", "title": "城堡里没有国王", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34519.htm", "intro": "好像在上演“宫－野蛮王妃”这一出剧，不同的是她是汶莱版剧情，她可是苏丹王从人口贩子手中买下的，买她这17岁“妈妈”送个37岁“女儿”，看在苏丹王说要给老妈锦衣玉食的份上，她就飞上枝头当王妃吧！只是她心中喜欢的是苏丹王，不是皇弟，爱上一个有家室的男人，痛苦啊！她必须离开汶莱才能好好呼吸，没想到国王竟不顾一切追来，原来是王后差点让他升天，他俩甜甜蜜蜜的忘了一切，也忘了有狗仔这号人物，风风火火气炸皇室所有人，连带皇弟老公也被气死！这下她的城堡更没有国王了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34519", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2190097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2190098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2190099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2190100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2190101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2190102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2190103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2190104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2190105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2190106.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2190107.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2190108.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2190109.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2190110.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2190111.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2190112.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2190113.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2190114.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2190115.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2190116.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2190117.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2190118.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2190119.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2190120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "21